    "enUS": {
      "description": "Eagan Peltskinner is looking for someone to hunt wolves for him.  That's good news, because we're seeing a lot more wolves in Northshire Valley lately.\n\nIf you're interested then speak with Eagan.  He's around the side of the abbey, to the left.",
